    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/8/3/83081.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "Look at that map, people. Look at that. We've made the world so hot that it looks like the Earth got its STD results back and it's got all of them. Why don't you use condoms, Earth? Why? Because they choke turtles? Oh, I get it now. I get it. And we've been hearing about global warming for a while, right? But when you see the numbers, you realize it's no joke.",
